            "text": "theorem normalized_angularStress (C : ℝ) (d : OutgoingTail.TailData) (y0 δ : ℝ) {eta : ℝ}\n    (heta : eta ^ 2 < 1) :\n    TerminalStress.terminalStress C d.h (TerminalPressure.outgoingTaper d y0)\n      (eta ^ 2) eta (TerminalEdgeFactor.profileRadius y0 δ) =\n        TerminalEdgeFactor.profileAngularStress C d y0 (eta, δ)"
